SUMMARY: Navigating Work Changes 職場權益知多少？
DESCRIPTION:Laid off? 😥 Terminated? 😩 Confused about severance or EI? ?
 ? Our workshop will break down common employment law issues in a clear an
 d practical way\, helping you better understand your workplace rights and
  the next steps available to you. 🦾\n\nDate: July 11 (Sat)\n\nTime: 2:00
 -3:00pm\n\nSpeaker: Edward Choi\n\nLanguage: English\n\nRegistration: for
 ms.cloud.microsoft/r/cTEyVpZpdm?origin=lprLink https://forms.cloud.micros
 oft/r/cTEyVpZpdm?origin=lprLink\n\nZoom meeting link will be sent after r
 egistration\n\n被裁員 😥、解僱 😩，或對遣散費及就業保險（EI）感到困惑？🙄 本工作坊將以清晰實用的方式講解常見僱傭法問題，
 幫助您更了解自己的職場權益，以及可採取的下一步行動。🦾\n\n日期: 7月18日(六)\n\n時間: 2:00-3:00pm\n\n講者: 蔡永
 聰律師\n\n語言: 廣東話 (即時國語翻譯)\n\n報名: forms.cloud.microsoft/r/cTEyVpZpdm?origin=
 lprLink https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/cTEyVpZpdm?origin=lprLink\n\n報名後會
 發出線上會議連結
